      "rationale": "גדו (gaddu) kɔrɔ ye 'dunun\/bɛn' ye — olu ye ladamu kumaw ye minnu bɛ jiri dugɛ; kumaw bɛɛ fila wajibiya i n'a fɔ 'aw ye jiri in dunun, aw ye a cew bɛn'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "weleli min bɛ taa",
      "rationale": "Ciden bɛ wele, nka mɔgɔ minnu bɛ a mɛn, u tɛ jira; dɔnniyagafeba 'aw' bɛ bɔ Heburukan fɔcogo la min jiralen tɛ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "mystery",
      "subject": "dilanjirali",
      "rationale": "Jiri in dununi ye dimi in ka kɔrɔ ye min tɛ Nabukadnetsar dɔn ho — jatebaga min bɔ sankolo na, a ye ɲɛmɔgɔ ye min bɛ jiři in baliya jira."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "A ye kan wuli ni fanga, ko nin ko: aw ye jiri in dunun, aw ye a cew bɛn, aw ye a yɛlɛnw wili bɔ, aw ye a jiridenw fanya; baganw ka wuli ka bɔ a jukɔrɔ, kɔnɔw ka bɔ a cew la.",
